<BaseLayout title="Privacy Policy | BK Accounting and Tax LLC" description="Website privacy information for BK Accounting and Tax LLC."><section class="section"><div class="container legal-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Privacy</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p><strong>Draft for professional review before launch.</strong></p><h2>Information you choose to provide</h2><p>When website forms or scheduling tools are enabled, we may receive information you choose to provide such as your name, contact details, service interest, and message.</p><h2>Sensitive information</h2><p>Do not submit Social Security numbers, tax documents, banking credentials, passwords, or similar sensitive information through a general website form.</p><h2>Third-party services</h2><p>The website may use third-party services for scheduling, analytics, spam prevention, hosting, or communications. This policy should be updated to reflect the services actually enabled before launch.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p>Questions about website privacy can be sent to <a href="mailto:belete@bkaccountingtax.com">belete@bkaccountingtax.com</a>.</p></div></section></BaseLayout><style>.legal-copy{max-width:850px}.legal-copy h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.5rem)}.legal-copy h2{font-size:1.8rem;margin-top:2.2rem}</style>